# --- repository exposure audit 2026-10-04 (docs/REPO_EXPOSURE_AUDIT.md) ---
# (a) secrets: env variants and key material; .env.example stays tracked (empty values)
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# local agent / editor state
.claude/

# (c) third-party papers (arXiv-id file names); government PDFs in docs/legal/ stay tracked
docs/legal/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].[0-9]*.pdf

# (d) LLM-generated paper material and prompts
docs/paper/reference_generated_draft.tex
docs/paper/DRAFT_STATUS.md
docs/paper/REVIEW_NOTES.md
docs/paper/OUTLINE*.md
**/*generated_draft*
docs/archive/paper_ieee/
docs/archive/paper_notes/
docs/archive/prompts/
docs/archive/REPO_CLEANUP_PLAN.md

# (e) PDFs of our own drafts / build output; the figure PDF is needed by the paper build
docs/paper/**/*.pdf
!docs/paper/submission/figures/*.pdf
docs/paper/submission/sections/*.tex
docs/paper/**/*.toc

# local audit report (contains identifying search terms)
docs/REPO_EXPOSURE_AUDIT.md

